 "type": "Manifest",
 "label": {
  "ja": [
   "ドバイメトロ 先頭車（近畿車輛）"
  ],
  "en": [
   "Dubai Metro end car (Kinki Sharyo)"
  ]
 },
 "summary": {
  "ja": [
   "ドバイの無人運転の地下鉄・高架鉄道ドバイメトロの、近畿車輛製の車の運転台側の端の車を、おもちゃの車台に載る大きさで起こした 3D モデル。銀と水色の標準の塗装。寸法は写真から読んだ。"
  ],
  "en": [
   "3D model of the end car of the Kinki Sharyo train of the Dubai Metro, Dubai's driverless metro, sized to sit on a toy chassis. Standard silver and light-blue livery. Dimensions were read from photographs."
  ]
 },
 "metadata": [
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
     "形式"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Class"
    ]
   },
   "value": {
    "ja": [
     "ドバイメトロの近畿車輛製の電車（5001-5079）。Wikidata に車両の形式の項目が無いので、このデータセットの形式 tb-dubaimetro を立てた。路線網のドバイメトロは Wikidata Q83787"
    ],
    "en": [
     "The Kinki Sharyo trains of the Dubai Metro (5001-5079). Wikidata has no item for the rolling stock, so this dataset gives it its own class, tb-dubaimetro. The Dubai Metro system is Wikidata Q83787"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
     "車両の種類"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Car type"
    ]
   },
   "value": {
    "ja": [
     "無人運転の 5 両編成の、端の車（運転台側）。車番は 5070 にした。"
    ],
    "en": [
     "The end car of the driverless five-car train. Numbered 5070."
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
     "塗装"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Livery"
    ]
   },
   "value": {
    "ja": [
     "標準の塗装（銀の車体、水色の帯、「ピクセル」の四角い模様、正面の黒い盾形と青い U 字）。2009 年と 2024 年の写真で同じ。特別塗装は作っていない"
    ],
    "en": [
     "The standard livery (silver body, light-blue band, square \"pixel\" pattern, black shield and blue U on the front), the same in 2009 and 2024 photographs. Special liveries are not modelled"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
     "模型の寸法"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Model size"
    ]
   },
   "value": {
    "ja": [
     "長さ 150 × 幅 40 × 高さ 38 mm（約 13.1 mm/m。鼻と運転台の側窓の 43 mm は縮尺どおり。残りの約 180 mm を 107 mm に詰めた。幅は 36.4 mm から車台に合わせて広げた）"
    ],
    "en": [
     "150 × 40 × 38 mm (about 13.1 mm/m. The 43 mm of the nose and cab window keep the scale; the rest, about 180 mm, is squashed to 107 mm. The width is widened from 36.4 mm to the chassis)"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
     "作り方"
    ],
    "en": [
     "How it was made"
    ]
   },
   "value": {
    "ja": [
     "Blender のスクリプトで、写真から読んだ寸法をもとに起こした（skytrain リポジトリの models/dubaimetro.py）"
    ],
    "en": [
     "Generated by a Blender script from dimensions read off photographs (models/dubaimetro.py in the skytrain repository)"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "ja": [
